note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Control for unroll-continue.om with unroll removed: a rolled loop accepts it (OMEGESE 9.8); exit 3.
note Contract section 4 line 90: continue in an unrolled body is error 9 (line 9, the continue). The
note same text without unroll (unroll-continue-rolled.om) is accepted and exits 3.
om2
fn main to int
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4
if eq i 2
continue
end
s = add s 1
end
ret int s
end
